  "fullDescription": "🎄 Vintage Christmas Seamless Digital Paper – 12 Pack 🎅\n\nBring a touch of nostalgic holiday charm to your creative projects with this Vintage Christmas Seamless Digital Paper Pack! 🎁 Featuring 12 beautifully designed 12×12″ PNG patterns, this collection includes classic Christmas motifs such as holly, nutcrackers, candy canes, snowflakes, Santa, and snowmen — all in rich, timeless holiday tones.\n\nPerfect for:\n✨ Scrapbooking\n✨ Sublimation projects\n✨ Planners and journals\n✨ Wrapping paper designs\n✨ Greeting cards and tags\n✨ Print on demand products\n✨ Holiday decor and more!\n\nEach design is seamless, making them easy to tile for endless creative possibilities.\n\nCapture the magic of a traditional Christmas and give your crafts that warm, vintage holiday feel! ❤️🎄\n\nIncluded:\n\n12 Seamless Digital Papers\n\nPNG format\n\n12×12 inches",
